1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,307
The same idea appears all over the syllabus.

2
00:00:03,307 --> 00:00:06,901
Ammonium chloride suppresses ammonium hydroxide.

3
00:00:06,901 --> 00:00:10,351
Hydrochloric acid suppresses hydrogen sulphide.

4
00:00:10,351 --> 00:00:14,921
Sodium chloride lowers the solubility of silver chloride.

5
00:00:14,921 --> 00:00:19,518
And hydrogen chloride gas makes pure salt crystallise from brine.

